{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "お疲れ様でした。これから第二回のビデオを始めたいと思います。ではよろしくお願いします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-1", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-1", "timestamp": 1783437381.6527398}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ではまず、今回の表現を復習しましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-2", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-2", "timestamp": 1783437384.6731794}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "の表現は二つありました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-3", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-3", "timestamp": 1783437390.4683845}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "まず一つ目:他社の人に挨拶する表現です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-4", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-4", "timestamp": 1783437397.2168443}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "表現は世話になっております。この表現を使うんでしたね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-5", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-5", "timestamp": 1783437403.9019086}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "にもっと丁寧に言う場合どうでしたか。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-6", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-6", "timestamp": 1783437407.4102592}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "いつもお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-7", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-7", "timestamp": 1783437410.4867287}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "お世話になっておりますの前にいつもという言葉を付け足すと、さらに丁寧になると思います。これは普段皆さんが挨拶、直接挨拶する場面やメールの場面でもよく使ったり見たりすることが多いと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-8", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-8", "timestamp": 1783437428.8304257}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "二つ目の表現は、他の人を紹介する場合です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-9", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-9", "timestamp": 1783437433.4911454}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は自分の名前を紹介する自己紹介でしたが、今回は他の人、他社を紹介する他社紹介になります", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-10", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-10", "timestamp": 1783437443.948629}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は自分の会社の人をお客様に紹介する場合です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-11", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-11", "timestamp": 1783437454.0592082}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "自社の人の名前でございます。表現を使います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-12", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-12", "timestamp": 1783437459.8291867}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": ":こちらは営業部長の永井でございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-13", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-13", "timestamp": 1783437465.0973086}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は営業部長の永井でございますこちらいう言葉を使いましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-14", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-14", "timestamp": 1783437476.5598907}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "次、今度は他社の人のことを紹介します。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-15", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-15", "timestamp": 1783437481.2065516}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "の会社の人に他社の人、つまりお客様を紹介する場面です。他社の人の名前様でいらっしゃいます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-16", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-16", "timestamp": 1783437494.8463671}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "例:こちらは、X社の開発部長の江藤様でいらっしゃいます", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-17", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-17", "timestamp": 1783437506.093798}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "二つの場面表現も異なりますね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-18", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-18", "timestamp": 1783437513.4564703}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "自分の会社の人は身内なのでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-19", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-19", "timestamp": 1783437519.3666208}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "て注意するポイントがありね。この名前の部分です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-20", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-20", "timestamp": 1783437525.589473}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "他社の人に自社の人を紹介する場合社の人にはさんや役職名は付けないこれがポイントです。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-21", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-21", "timestamp": 1783437539.680979}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "の場合は永井な、自分にとって部長の永井長い部長を他社の人に紹介する場合", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-22", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-22", "timestamp": 1783437548.4489}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "他社の人が一番目上の立場になるのでこの永井さんでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-23", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-23", "timestamp": 1783437557.144938}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "長い部長でございます。この表現は使いません。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-24", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-24", "timestamp": 1783437561.83263}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "前に部長の永井でございます役職名がなかった場合は永井でございます。というふに紹介します。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-25", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-25", "timestamp": 1783437573.822981}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "次、他社の人の名前を紹介する場合は必ず様、またはさんでもいいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-26", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-26", "timestamp": 1783437591.5008018}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "何々さん、何々様こを絶対忘れないように注意してくださいでは談話で練習していきましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-27", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-27", "timestamp": 1783437596.937322}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は二。他社の人に挨拶をする場面での談話です。ではリピートしてください。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-28", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-28", "timestamp": 1783437605.447293}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "御社を担当させていただきます。オリエンタル商事のAでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-29", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-29", "timestamp": 1783437611.5098608}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-30", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-30", "timestamp": 1783437618.199003}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "Aさんですかいつもお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-31", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-31", "timestamp": 1783437626.106096}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "営業部のbでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-32", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-32", "timestamp": 1783437630.902982}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "こそどうぞよろしくお願いいします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-33", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-33", "timestamp": 1783437635.728147}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "では、内容を確認したいと思います。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-34", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-34", "timestamp": 1783437641.9581127}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "はaは新しい担当者として挨拶をしている場面ですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-35", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-35", "timestamp": 1783437645.989684}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "御社、これはお客様の会社、あなたの会社になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-36", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-36", "timestamp": 1783437659.8186636}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "あなたの会社を担当させていただきますは自分が担当するの丁寧は使役形プラスでいただきます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-37", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-37", "timestamp": 1783437669.3400671}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は自分の好意を丁寧に相手に鍛えてる、鍛える場面に使う表現です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-38", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-38", "timestamp": 1783437682.1562886}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ばこちらで待たせていただきますで待ちますではなくて、ここで待たせていただきます", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-39", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-39", "timestamp": 1783437683.1266503}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "だと丁寧に自分の行為を相手に報告しています。ただし注意点があります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-40", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-40", "timestamp": 1783437693.8697436}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "動詞のて形いただきます。これだとその行為は相手になってしまいます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-41", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-41", "timestamp": 1783437701.061431}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "担当していただきますだと相手に依頼する表現になてしまうのでこは注意が必要です。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-42", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-42", "timestamp": 1783437710.803833}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "自分の行為の場合は使役でいただきますを使いましょう、それでは会話です。次の会話は、担当交代の挨拶の会話になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-43", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-43", "timestamp": 1783437727.0674887}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "では、今回も皆さんリピートしてください。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-44", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-44", "timestamp": 1783437730.7635987}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "いつもお世話になっております。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-45", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-45", "timestamp": 1783437733.9691374}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "この度、御社の担当が変わりましたので後任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-46", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-46", "timestamp": 1783437746.5199163}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "はご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-47", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-47", "timestamp": 1783437751.154225}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "が私の後任のチン・シュウメイでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-48", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-48", "timestamp": 1783437757.822219}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "私同様、よろしお願いいします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-49", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-49", "timestamp": 1783437764.0881793}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "このたび御社を担当させていただくことになりました、チンでございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-50", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-50", "timestamp": 1783437772.7832735}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "チンさんですか。木村でございます。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-51", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-51", "timestamp": 1783437780.0671012}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-52", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-52", "timestamp": 1783437784.9514105}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "精一杯頑張りますので、こちらこそよろしくお願いいします。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-53", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-53", "timestamp": 1783437792.8182614}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ではもう一度内容を確認しましょう。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-54", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-54", "timestamp": 1783437799.267212}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は、担当交代の挨拶の会話になります。登場人物は三人永井さん木村さん、チンさんの三人になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-55", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-55", "timestamp": 1783437812.3604226}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は永井さんがいつもお世話になっておりますと会話を始めています", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-56", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-56", "timestamp": 1783437816.313315}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "が実はこのたび御社の担当が変わりましたので、こう", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-57", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-57", "timestamp": 1783437825.3829534}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-58", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-58", "timestamp": 1783437832.2535665}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "後任、これの意味は後の任務者、あとの担当者ということですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-59", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-59", "timestamp": 1783437833.2227437}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "後任の者を連れてご挨拶に参りました。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-60", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-60", "timestamp": 1783437843.337571}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "ですからつまり永井さんは前任者、今まで担当していた人ということになります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-61", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-61", "timestamp": 1783437850.8898134}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "は新しい担当者、後の任務者の人を連れて一緒に二人で挨拶に来たという場面ですね。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-62", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-62", "timestamp": 1783437858.8338008}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "に対して木村さんが、それはご丁寧に恐れ入ります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-63", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-63", "timestamp": 1783437867.4948893}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "恐れ入りますこれはすみませんの丁寧ですね。すみませんの謙譲語になります。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-64", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-64", "timestamp": 1783437876.6816397}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "恐れ入りますわざ挨拶に来てくれたことに対して、あ、それはわざ丁寧に来てくださってありがとうございます", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-65", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-65", "timestamp": 1783437885.7852974}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "という表現になりますから永井さん。", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-66", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-66", "timestamp": 1783437895.1674256}
{"run_id": "live-v3.3.5.5.8.5.21-20260708-001605-91028b12", "ui_text": "こちらが私の後任の", "speaker_label": "Speaker 2", "ui_segment_id": "ui-67", "source_stable_commit_id": "stable-67", "timestamp": 1783437897.2986345}
